note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception
note Fixed 2-word fp8 group descriptor. ent 0 is the weight VA, ent 1 the scale VA.
note id is the group index, wv and sv the base VAs, ws and ss the strides.
note The caller loops groups and keeps the launch. No oversized view.
fn av_fp8en id ulong wv ulong sv ulong ws ulong ss ulong ent edit ulong 2 to ulong
put ent 0 add wv mul id ws
put ent 1 add sv mul id ss
ret 0
end
